OL,3,ADeath toll from Philippines ferry fire
OL,4,Aclimbs to 35, with dozens still missing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe country's coast guard says more
OL,7,Fbodies remain on the boat, which they
OL,8,Fwere unable to board until Friday due
OL,9,Fto toxic fumes and lingering heat.
